            <div xml:id="d486">

                <pb facs="0676" n="596" sameAs="frus:frus1936v01/pg596"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Italy/290: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Italy</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1936-06-08T11:00:00+01:00">June 8, 1936—11
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 8—6:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>199. Department’s 56, June 5, 5 p.m. I called by appointment on the Minister of
                    Finance this morning and communicated to him the substance of the Department’s
                    instruction referred to above. He said he would confer with the Chief of the
                    Government on the matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kirk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
